        "# Create a Draft Quarto Document from an Existing PowerPoint\n",
        "\n",
        "## Select the Source and Output\n",
        "\n",
        "This chunk sets the source, output path, and diagram-group setting for the audit and conversion chunks below. It prints the paths but does not create a draft.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Set `source` to the PowerPoint file and `output_qmd` to the desired `.qmd` path.\n",
        "- The output folder must be new or empty. Keep editing an existing draft directly; rerunning this converter will refuse its populated folder.\n",
        "- Group every component of each diagram in PowerPoint and save it. With `group_images=True`, each outer group becomes one static image using PowerPoint on macOS. Surrounding text and slide layout still need review.\n",
        "- Set `group_images=False` to use ordinary conversion. The audit and conversion chunks may request PowerPoint access to a temporary export folder when exporting groups."
      ],
      "id": "78381ed2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "\n",
        "source = '/Users/bradcannell/Library/CloudStorage/Box-Box/2026/APHS 20203 W5-Aossication and Causality.pptx'\n",
        "output_qmd = lecture_root / \"Module 05 - Association and Causality/Association and Causality/Association and Causality.qmd\"\n",
        "# Preserve explicit diagram groups; switch this off for ordinary conversion.\n",
        "group_images = True\n",
